SUMMARY:2839 - Festive Charcuterie Board Building 
DESCRIPTION:Gather your friends or loved ones and join Dorothy Weber for a festive hands-on class celebrating the art of building a beautiful and delicious charcuterie board. You’ll learn simple styling techniques\, creative presentation ideas\, and easy homemade additions that will elevate any holiday gathering.  \nHands on. Ages 16 and up \n\nCaramel Grapes\nSalami Roulades\nCreamy Herb Cheese Dip\nSweet & Spiced Glazed Pecans\nChantilly Cream Filled Strawberries\nAssorted Meats\, Artisan Cheeses & Crackers\nCharcuterie Styling Tips\, Pairings & Presentation Techniques
