SUMMARY:2848 - Christmas Cookies and Cocktails 
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season in style with an elevated cookie and cocktail workshop. Pastry Chef Faith Kennedy will guide you through crafting buttery shortbreads with festive fillings\, practicing royal icing decoration\, and sipping on two cozy holiday cocktails – boozy hot chocolate and mulled wine. A perfect blend of flavor\, flair\, and festive fun. \nHands on. Ages 21 and up. Vegetarian.  \n\nChocolate Dipped peppermint cookies\nLinzer Star Cookies\nGingerbread Men\nGingerbread White Russian\nRumchata Hot Cocoa
