SUMMARY:2849 - Edible Gifts from the Kitchen 
DESCRIPTION:Share the joy of the season with thoughtful\, homemade gifts everyone will love! In this hands-on class\, Chef Sophia Dickmyer will guide you through creating a collection of festive edible treats that are perfect for holiday gifting\, hostess presents\, or stocking stuffers. You’ll learn simple techniques\, creative packaging ideas\, and leave with beautiful handmade gifts ready to share with family and friends. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up \n\nHot Chocolate Bombs\nChocolate Chip Cookie Mix in a Jar\nSweet & Spiced Candied Nuts\nGingerbread Granola
