SUMMARY:2850 - The Perfect Christmas Dinner: Beef Wellington 
DESCRIPTION:Make your holiday table unforgettable with a show-stopping Beef Wellington. In this festive hands-on class\, Chef Joe Hall will guide you through each step of preparing the ultimate Christmas dinner – from mastering the golden\, flaky Wellington to creating elegant sides and a whimsical holiday dessert. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nBeef Wellington\nHorseradish Cream Sauce\nHaricots Verts \nGarlic Herb Potatoes\nIce Cream Snowball
