SUMMARY:2851 - Traditional Ukrainian Christmas and New Year
DESCRIPTION:Take a journey to Ukrainian Christmas with Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya and discover the rich traditions of her homeland while learning to make classic holiday dishes. From borsch to varenyky and kutia\, you’ll explore the heartwarming recipes that have been passed down through generations. Join us for a festive culinary experience celebrating family\, food\, and tradition! \nHands on. Ages 16 and up.  \n\nKutia- traditional wheat berry porridge\nTraditional Ukrainian Borsch \nPotato Dumplings with Caramelized Onions\nSoft Glazed Gingerbread Cookies with Preserves\nUzvar – dried fruit drink 
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2851-traditional-ukrainian-christmas-and-new-year/
