SUMMARY:2852 - Santa’s Smokehouse
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with bold barbecue flavors in this festive demonstration-style class! Join Chef Jeremy Losinno as he shares the techniques behind creating smoky\, slow-cooked holiday favorites\, along with creative sides and a sweet treat with an unexpected twist. You’ll pick up expert tips for smoking\, flavor layering\, and holiday entertaining while enjoying a relaxed and delicious evening. \nDemonstration. Ages 16 and up \n\nSmoked Beef Short Ribs \nTexas Mop Sauce\nHouse-Made BBQ Kettle Chips\nSmoked Tallow Chocolate Chip Cookies
