SUMMARY:2855 - Soups\, Stews and Breads
DESCRIPTION:Warm up the kitchen with a comforting winter menu featuring rich\, hearty soups\, rustic stews\, and golden homemade breads. Chef Helen Chudakova-Sanya will teach you to build deep\, layered flavors and bake cozy\, satisfying sides that bring every bowl to life.\nPartial Hands on. Ages 16 and up. \n● Roasted Winter Vegetable Soup Purée\n● Tuscan Kale\, Sausage & Potato Soup\n● Beef & Red Wine Stew\n● Cheddar Chive Biscuits\n● Classic Soft Dinner Rolls
