SUMMARY:2856 - Potatoes Without Borders
DESCRIPTION:Discover the incredible versatility of the humble potato with Chef Instructor Sophia Dickmyer! In this fun\, hands-on class\, you’ll travel the world through delicious potato traditions\, exploring unique flavors\, cooking techniques\, and creative ways to transform this beloved ingredient. From crispy and golden to soft and comforting\, you’ll discover why potatoes are a favorite in kitchens across the globe! \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nGreek Crispy Lemon Potatoes\nFrench Pommes Duchesse\nPolish Pierogi\nSouth Korean Gamja-jeon
