SUMMARY:2857 - Dumplings Around the World
DESCRIPTION:Travel the world one delicious bite at a time with Chef Instructor Helen Chudakova-Sanya! In this exciting\, hands-on class\, you’ll explore the rich culinary traditions of savory-filled favorites from different corners of the globe. Learn the art of preparing flavorful fillings\, mastering folding and shaping techniques\, and creating irresistible homemade bites that bring people together. Discover just how much flavor and tradition can fit into one little pocket! \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nJapanese Gyoza with Dipping Sauce\nEastern European Potato Dumplings with Bacon and Caramelized Onion\nPortuguese Empanadas
