SUMMARY:2858 - Parent and Child: Soup Suppers
DESCRIPTION:Warm up the kitchen and create delicious memories with Chef Instructor Gwen Eberly! In this cozy\, hands-on family cooking class\, you’ll discover the joy of preparing comforting homemade favorites together. Learn simple cooking techniques\, explore hearty seasonal flavors\, and enjoy the satisfaction of creating a delicious meal from scratch. Perfect class for those looking to spend quality time together while having fun in the kitchen! \nHands on. Ages 5 and up. Tickets are priced per person. \n\nTurkey Parmesan Meatball Soup with Orzo and Spinach\nHomemade Flaky Biscuits\nDelicious Apple Crisp A la Mode\n\n 
