SUMMARY:2859 - Sourdough 101
DESCRIPTION:Discover the art and science of sourdough with Chef Instructor Mike Wetherhold! Learn how to care for a starter\, recognize properly developed dough\, and work through the fundamentals of mixing\, shaping\, and baking. Whether you’re brand-new to bread or ready to refine your technique\, this class will help you bake with greater confidence. \nDemonstration. Ages 16 and up \n\nHow to create and maintain your sourdough starter\nLearn the process from start to finish to make 2 loaves\nTaste different sourdough with delicious butter and jams\nTake-home kit with active sourdough starter and everything you need to make fresh bread\n\n 
