SUMMARY:2860 - Fresh Pasta: Winter Comfort
DESCRIPTION:Roll up your sleeves with Chef Instructor Helen Chudakova-Sanya and discover the satisfaction of making pasta from scratch. Learn how to work with dough\, build texture and flavor\, and pair your creations with delicious accompaniments. This hands-on class turns a few simple ingredients into a memorable homemade meal. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nFresh Pasta Dough\nFettuccine with Traditional Ragu Bolognese\nRicotta Ravioli with Hazelnut Brown Sage Butter Sauce\n\n 
