SUMMARY:2861 - Ramen From Scratch
DESCRIPTION:Warm up with Chef Instructor Helen Chudakova-Sanya as you explore the layers of flavor behind a comforting bowl of noodles. Learn how to build a fragrant broth\, make noodles from scratch\, prepare satisfying toppings\, and bring everything together for a beautifully balanced dish. This hands-on experience celebrates the care and technique behind a favorite comfort food. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nRamen Noodles From Scratch\nMiso Ramen Dashi\nThe Perfect Soy Sauce Marinated Egg\nCrispy Pork Belly
