SUMMARY:2862 - American Steakhouse Classics
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Instructor Joe Hall for a hands-on cooking experience inspired by the refined flavors of a restaurant-quality dinner. Practice professional techniques for preparing the featured entrée and its accompaniments while learning tips for timing\, seasoning\, and elegant presentation. You’ll leave ready to bring a little steakhouse polish to your own table. \nHands on. Ages 21 and up. \n\nSteak au Poivre with Creamy Cognac Sauce and Asparagus\nWedge Salad with Bacon Lardons and Blue Cheese\n“Half Baked” Chocolate Chip Cookie Skillet à la Mode\nEspresso Martini\n\n 
