SUMMARY:2863 - French Macarons: Café Collection
DESCRIPTION:Discover the elegance and artistry of macarons with Pastry Chef Ruby Shenk! In this delightful\, hands-on class\, you’ll explore the secrets to creating beautiful\, delicate shells and luscious fillings inspired by your favorite café flavors. Learn professional pastry techniques\, experiment with exciting flavor combinations\, and master the skills to create these colorful\, irresistible treats in your own kitchen! \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. Gluten Free. Vegetarian \n\nLondon Fog Macarons with a London Fog Ganache\nCafe Mocha Macarons with a Dark Chocolate Espresso Ganache\nStrawberry Matcha Macarons with Swiss Meringue Buttercream
