SUMMARY:2864 - Date Night: Sushi 101
DESCRIPTION:Join Chef Instructor Helen Chudakova-Sanya and discover how approachable homemade sushi can be. Practice the fundamentals of preparing and seasoning rice\, assembling flavorful fillings\, and rolling and presenting your creations. You’ll gain the skills and confidence to plan your own sushi night at home. \nHands on. Ages 18 and up. Gluten Free. Tickets are priced per person \n\nSushi Rice\nHand Rolls\nInside Out Rolls\nOnigiri
