SUMMARY:2865 - Special Event: The Big Game Appetizers with Eagles Pro Shop
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for the ultimate game day celebration with Chef Instructor Jeremy Losinno! In this exciting\, hands-on class\, you’ll bring your appetizer game to the next level with crowd-pleasing flavors\, creative recipes\, and winning cooking techniques. Whether you’re hosting a football party or cheering from the couch\, you’ll leave ready to impress your fellow fans with delicious homemade favorites. Come hungry\, show your Eagles pride\, and get ready for a fantastic time in the kitchen! \nHands-on. Ages 16 and up. \nSpecial Event Perks: Every participant receives an Eagles hat and apron\, plus a chance to win a mystery signed item from the Eagles Pro Shop! Guests will also have a chance to win a gift basket filled with goodies from the Zest Store and Eagles Pro Shop\, generously provided by the Shops @ Rockvale. \n  \n\nBaby Back Ribwich sliders\nSmoked SPAM with pineapple infused BBQ sauce.\nSmoked Cream Cheese with apricot preserves and homemade hot honey drizzle.\nCheesesteak Nachos with cooper sharp cheese sauce
URL:https://zestchef.com/class/2865-special-event-the-big-game-appetizers-with-eagles-pro-shop/
