SUMMARY:2866 - Midnight Street Carnival
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a late-night food adventure with Chef Instructor Sophia Dickmyer! In this fun\, hands-on class\, you’ll explore the bold flavors and irresistible comfort foods inspired by bustling street food scenes and midnight cravings. From crispy\, cheesy bites to savory favorites and indulgent sweet treats\, you’ll learn exciting cooking techniques and create the ultimate lineup of street food favorites. \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nFried Mozzarella\nStreet Tacos al Pastor\nCheeseburger Bombs\nDeep Fried Oreos
