SUMMARY:2867 - Chicken Butchering 101
DESCRIPTION:Discover the art of cooking with the whole chicken alongside Chef Instructor Helen Chudakova-Sanya! In this practical\, hands-on class\, you’ll learn professional poultry butchering techniques\, explore creative ways to use every part of the bird\, and transform simple ingredients into delicious\, comforting dishes. From mastering essential knife skills to building rich flavors through different cooking methods\, you’ll gain confidence\, reduce kitchen waste\, and discover how versatile one chicken can be! \nHands on. Ages 16 and up. \n\nWhole animal butchering\nTips and tricks on using all parts of the chicken\nChicken Bone Broth\nSouthern Buttermilk Fried Chicken\nBraised Chicken Thighs in Apple Cider\nGreen Apple and Kohlrabi Slaw
